[starts|start]] [[his]] [[first]] [[show]]. \`[[Hello]], [[hello]]! You're [[on]] [[Radio]] Lotus! [[Let]] [[me]] [[introduce]] [[the]] [[show]]. [[I]] [[am|be]] Nam, [[from]] [[number]] 4.\` [[He]] [[speaks|speak]] [[for]] [[ten]] [[minutes|minute]]. [[He]] [[plays|play]] [[a]] [[song]]. [[Nobody]] [[phones|phone]].`,`vn`:`Th\u1ee9 B\u1ea3y, Nam b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u bu\u1ed5i ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. \`A l\u00f4, a l\u00f4! \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 Radio Lotus! Xin gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i. T\u00f4i l\u00e0 Nam, nh\u00e0 s\u1ed1 4.\` C\u1eadu n\u00f3i li\u1ec1n m\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u00fat. C\u1eadu m\u1edf m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t. Ch\u1eb3ng ai g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn.`},{`en`:`[[Soon]], [[somebody]] [[comes|come]] [[up]] [[to]] [[the]] [[room]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] Grandma Sau, [[a]] [[neighbour]]. [[She]] [[knows|know]] [[everything]] [[about]] Lotus Street. \`[[Hi]], Nam. [[Can]] [[I]] [[speak]] [[on]] [[your]] [[radio]]?\` \`[[Yes]]! [[Our]] [[first]] [[visitor]]!\``,`vn`:`L\u00e1t sau, c\u00f3 ai \u0111\u00f3 \u0111i l\u00ean ph\u00f2ng. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 b\u00e0 S\u00e1u h\u00e0ng x\u00f3m. Chuy\u1ec7n g\u00ec c\u1ee7a ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen b\u00e0 c\u0169ng bi\u1ebft. \`Ch\u00e0o Nam. B\u00e0 n\u00f3i l\u00ean \u0111\u00e0i c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?\` \`\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1ea1! V\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang ta!\``},{`en`:`Nam [[wants|want]] [[to]] [[sound]] [[cool]]. \`[[Hey]], [[everybody]]! [[What's|what]] [[up]]?\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. Grandma Sau [[looks|look]] [[at]] [[him]]. \`[[What]] [[language]] [[is|be]] [[that]]?\` \`[[It]] [[is|be]] an English [[phrase]],\` [[says|say]] Nam. \`[[It]] [[means|mean]] '[[How]] [[are|be]] [[you]]?'\` \`[[Then]] [[say]] [[it]] [[in]] Vietnamese! [[Speak]] [[our]] [[language]], [[please]]!\``,`vn`:`Nam mu\u1ed1n t\u1ecf ra s\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec7u. \`H\u00e2y, m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u01a1i! What's up?\` c\u1eadu n\u00f3i. B\u00e0 S\u00e1u nh\u00ecn c\u1eadu. \`Th\u1ee9 ti\u1ebfng g\u00ec th\u1ebf?\` \`\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u ti\u1ebfng Anh \u1ea1,\` Nam n\u00f3i. \`Ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 'M\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u1ecfe kh\u00f4ng?'\` \`Th\u1ebf th\u00ec n\u00f3i b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t \u0111i. N\u00f3i ti\u1ebfng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u0111i ch\u00e1u!\``},{`en`:`Grandma Sau [[uses|use]] [[a]] [[lot]] [[of]] [[old]] [[words|word]]. \`[[Your]] [[radio]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[cup]] [[of]] [[hot]] [[tea]] [[on]] [[a]] [[cold]] [[night]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Sorry]]?\` [[says|say]] Nam. \`[[Can]] [[you]] [[repeat]] [[that]]?\` [[She]] [[repeats|repeat]] [[it]]. \`[[Oh]]! [[What]] [[is|be]] [[the]] [[meaning]]? [[Can]] [[you]] [[explain]]?\` \`[[It]] [[means|mean]] [[I]] [[like]] [[it]], [[boy]]!\` \`[[OK]]. [[Yeah]]. [[Thanks]]!\``,`vn`:`B\u00e0 S\u00e1u hay d\u00f9ng nh\u1eefng l\u1eddi l\u1ebd x\u01b0a. \`C\u00e1i \u0111\u00e0i c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u nh\u01b0 ch\u00e9n tr\u00e0 n\u00f3ng gi\u1eefa \u0111\u00eam l\u1ea1nh,\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i. \`D\u1ea1, g\u00ec c\u01a1 \u1ea1?\` Nam h\u1ecfi. \`B\u00e0 nh\u1eafc l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng \u1ea1?\` B\u00e0 nh\u1eafc l\u1ea1i. \`\u1ed2! Th\u1ebf ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 g\u00ec \u1ea1? B\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?\` \`Ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 b\u00e0 th\u00edch n\u00f3, th\u1eb1ng b\u00e9 n\u00e0y!\` \`D\u1ea1. V\u00e2ng. Ch\u00e1u c\u1ea3m \u01a1n b\u00e0!\``},{`en`:`[[Then]] [[she]] [[looks|look]] [[out]] [[of]] [[the]] [[window]]. \`[[Now]], [[let]] [[me]] [[tell]] [[you]] [[something]] [[about]] [[this]] [[street]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Something]] [[nobody]] [[knows|know]].\` [[But]] [[then]] Nam's [[mum]] [[shouts|shout]] [[from]] [[the]] [[kitchen]]: \`Nam! [[Dinner]]!\` [[And]] [[Radio]] Lotus [[goes|go]] [[quiet]].`,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i b\u00e0 nh\u00ecn ra c\u1eeda s\u1ed5. \`Gi\u1edd th\u00ec \u0111\